        "subject": "LU-20443 llite: use atomic state machine for statahead threads",
        "message": "LU-20443 llite: use atomic state machine for statahead threads\n\nReplace smp barrier based synchronization on sai_task and unsafe\naccess to lli_sa_enabled with atomic state machine to fix race\nconditions between start_statahead_thread() and\nll_deauthorize_statahead().\n\nThis introduces sai_task_st atomic state field and new helper\nfunctions (ll_sa_thread_should_stop, ll_sa_thread_stop,\nll_sa_thread_wait_event) to centralize thread state management,\nimproving code maintainability.\n\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity env=ONLY=123\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity env=ONLY=123\nSigned-off-by: Etienne AUJAMES <eaujames@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I3e4ffc991795029057326982513b7a270f1238ad\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
